save_tcod_software_package
_name.category_id                tcod_software
_description.text
; Software package used to compute and produce the DFT-computed structure file.
  Only package or program name should be used, e.g. 'VASP', 'psi3', 'Abinit', etc.
;
_definition.update               2026-10-26
_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Text
_definition.id                   '_tcod_software_package'
_name.object_id                  '_tcod_software_package'
save_
save_tcod_software_package_version
_name.category_id                tcod_software
_description.text
; Software package version used to compute and produce the computed
  structure file. Only version designator should be used, e.g. '3.4.0',
  '2.1rc3'. It is desirable that the combination of the _tcod_software_package
  and _tcod_software_package_version values would uniquely identify the code
  that was used for computations.
;
_definition.update               2026-10-26
_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Text
_definition.id                   '_tcod_software_package_version'
_name.object_id                  '_tcod_software_package_version'
save_
save_tcod_software_package_compilation_date
_name.category_id                tcod_software
_description_example.case        2014-11-04T13:49:49.290475Z
_description.text
; ISO 8601 (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format timestamp of
  the time when the executable was compiled.

  Should correspond to the
  https://www.xml-cml.org/dictionary/compchem/#compileDate data
  element, but MUST be expressed in the ISO standard format.
;
_definition.update               2026-10-26
_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Text
_definition.id                   '_tcod_software_package_compilation_date'
_name.object_id                  '_tcod_software_package_compilation_date'
save_
save_tcod_software_package_compilation_environment
_name.category_id                tcod_software
_description.text
; A set of environment variable definitions, in /bin/sh syntax
(i.e. using the "NAME=VALUE" syntax) for all relevant environment
variables that were active when compiling this package. You can get the
list in this syntax from the Unix/Linux 'printenv' command.
;
_definition.update               2026-10-26
_definition.class                Datum
_type.container                  Single
_type.contents                   Text
_definition.id
'_tcod_software_package_compilation_environment'
_name.object_id
'_tcod_software_package_compilation_environment'
